# Public Headers

This directory contains declarations for the APP, HAL, and MCAL layers.

| Directory | Files | Responsibility |
|---|---|---|
| `APP/` | `clock_app.h` | Clock initialization and main loop API |
| `HAL/` | `lcd.h`, `pushbuttons.h`, `buzzer.h` | Peripheral APIs and pin mappings |
| `MCAL/` | `gpio.h`, `timer0.h`, `timer1.h`, `pcint.h` | AVR register-level GPIO, timer, and interrupt APIs |

Source modules include these files with paths such as `APP/clock_app.h`, `HAL/lcd.h`, or `MCAL/gpio.h`.
